    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "Supabase 发布 Multigres v0.1 Alpha",
      "summary": "Postgres 的水平扩展一直缺一个像 Vitess 那样的编排层。Supabase 把 Multigres 定位成 Postgres 的可扩展操作系统，目标覆盖分片、连接池、自动故障转移和备份编排，v0.1 Alpha 只开源、不面向生产，更像早期路线公布和征集合作。判断它能不能用要盯几处边界：分片键怎么选、跨分片事务怎么办、连接池放在哪一层、故障转移语义、备份恢复流程和扩展兼容性。",
      "url": "https://supabase.com/blog/multigres-v0-1-alpha",
      "author": "Supabase",
      "source": "Supabase 博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-04",
      "image": "https://supabase.com/images/blog/2026-06-01-multigres-v0-1-alpha/og.jpg",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "水平扩展",
        "高可用"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "AWS 用智能体自动改写 Oracle PL/SQL 到 PostgreSQL",
      "summary": "AWS DMS 的模式转换能搬走大部分表结构，存储过程、函数和触发器这类复杂 PL/SQL 对象却往往要人工重写。AWS 的方案把 Bedrock 上的 Claude Sonnet 4.6、Strands Agents 框架和 AWS Knowledge MCP 服务器串起来：读 DMS 评估报告，从 Oracle 取源码，用模型转换，经 Lambda 部署到 Aurora PostgreSQL 做校验，再逐个对象跑九项自动测试，厂商测得的平均置信度是 92%。",
      "url": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/database/automate-oracle-pl-sql-to-postgresql-migration-with-amazon-bedrock-and-strands-agents/",
      "author": "Kavita Vellala",
      "source": "AWS 数据库博客",
      "source_date": "2026-06-08",
      "image": "https://d2908q01vomqb2.cloudfront.net/887309d048beef83ad3eabf2a79a64a389ab1c9f/2026/06/02/DB5498.png",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "迁移",
        "Oracle",
        "智能体"
      ],
      "position": 2
